{"record":"event","seq":0,"at":1794120132745,"author":"sample","why":"A case file. A watch went from Rosalind Vane's study one evening, and there are three people it could have been, or someone nobody has thought of. Each account is a node saying who gave it, with how far it's believed, and when each suspect could have reached the house is worked out from those. The Worlds tab gives how likely each suspect is, and what's most worth finding out next. Pin what you learn.","ops":[{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e30c499352e","component":"name","to":{"value":"The case"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e30c499352e","component":"body","to":{"value":"Saturday evening at Rosalind Vane's house. Her late husband's gold watch was in a locked case in the study. Clara saw it there at 9:00. Rosalind found the case open and the watch gone at 10:15. Times here are minutes past nine, so 9:40 is 40."}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","component":"name","to":{"value":"Who took it?"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","component":"decision","to":{"value":{}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","component":"uncertain","to":{"value":null}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","component":"arrives","to":{"rule":{"rule":"expr@1","params":{"text":"pick(o in in.alternative: o.arrives)"}}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","component":"from_garden","to":{"rule":{"rule":"expr@1","params":{"text":"pick(o in in.alternative: o.from_garden)"}}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e323811122a","component":"name","to":{"value":"Suspect[Tom]"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e323811122a","component":"body","to":{"value":"Rosalind's nephew. He owes money, and he knew where the key to the case was kept."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e323811122a","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":3.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e33041ed47d","component":"name","to":{"value":"Suspect[Mr Pryce]"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e33041ed47d","component":"body","to":{"value":"The neighbour. He collects watches, and offered to buy this one in May. She said no."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e33041ed47d","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":3.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e344fbfd483","component":"name","to":{"value":"Suspect[Clara]"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e344fbfd483","component":"body","to":{"value":"The housekeeper. She has a key to the study, and was in the house all evening."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e344fbfd483","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":2.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3553ee7193","component":"name","to":{"value":"Suspect[Someone else]"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3553ee7193","component":"body","to":{"value":"Someone nobody has thought of yet."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3553ee7193","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e319030b8e5","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":1.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3553ee7193","component":"unknown","to":{"value":null}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e36f7d0daac","component":"name","to":{"value":"When did Tom leave the Red Lion?"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e36f7d0daac","component":"decision","to":{"value":{}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e36f7d0daac","component":"uncertain","to":{"value":null}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e36f7d0daac","component":"value","to":{"rule":{"rule":"expr@1","params":{"text":"pick(in.alternative)"}}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3740aabc60","component":"name","to":{"value":"At 9:40, as the barman says"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3740aabc60","component":"value","to":{"value":40.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3740aabc60","component":"body","to":{"value":"The barman remembers calling time on Tom's tab at twenty to ten."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3740aabc60","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e36f7d0daac","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":3.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3854ceb550","component":"name","to":{"value":"At about 9:10, as Mrs Dale says"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3854ceb550","component":"value","to":{"value":10.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3854ceb550","component":"body","to":{"value":"Mrs Dale was at the next table, and thinks he went just after nine. She'd had a few."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3854ceb550","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e36f7d0daac","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":1.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e39daec9b36","component":"name","to":{"value":"How did Tom get to the house?"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e39daec9b36","component":"decision","to":{"value":{}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e39daec9b36","component":"uncertain","to":{"value":null}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e39daec9b36","component":"value","to":{"rule":{"rule":"expr@1","params":{"text":"pick(in.alternative)"}}}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3a74daf6a4","component":"name","to":{"value":"By bike, 25 minutes"}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3a74daf6a4","component":"value","to":{"value":25.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3a74daf6a4","component":"body","to":{"value":"Tom says his car was at the garage, so he cycled."}},{"op":"link","from":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3a74daf6a4","to":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e39daec9b36","kind":"alternative","value":{"weight":2.0}},{"op":"set","id":"01a1b9e4-a886-77bd-8ae3-1e3bdb4eaed3","component":"name","to":{"value":"By car, 10 minutes"}},{"op":"set","id